{"authored" [{"question" "q-158026" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}{x}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "46dbe064e7d548bc283b07a09958fc59b77b8700062f68f20f01d2ba9a3bc5eb" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡y}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡y} \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =3{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int 3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int 3{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡y & ={x}^{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡y={x}^{3}+C.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "46dbe064e7d548bc283b07a09958fc59b77b8700062f68f20f01d2ba9a3bc5eb" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡y=\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡y={x}^{3}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{tan}⁡y=\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{tan}⁡y={x}^{3}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\text{ }y={x}^{3}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{sin}⁡y={x}^{3}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158117" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ for $y\\ne 0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158117" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|y| & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158117" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "46dbe064e7d548bc283b07a09958fc59b77b8700062f68f20f01d2ba9a3bc5eb" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158117" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae0