ibute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "y={e}^{-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}+K"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-158014" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "y={e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}+K"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-3850" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x{e}^{-y}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-3850" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x{e}^{-y} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{x}{{e}^{y}} \\\\ {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{y} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n{e}^{y}=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-3850" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "46dbe064e7d548bc283b07a09958fc59b77b8700062f68f20f01d2ba9a3bc5eb" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-3850" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "027204b3cbdf3a65f7eb179b07ae00d638522aef9bb0c783f1db77ebff526c31" "basis" 1158 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-3850" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "y=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})}{2}+C"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14012237/state.json" "file_sha256" "02